  Each arm is follower.urdf verbatim with its names prefixed, so followerd/leaderd poses (link6-7
  in base_link) convert to this frame by the fixed <side>_base_joint transform only. Camera names
  match configs/camerad.yaml: left_wrist, right_wrist, head.
